§§ `Rule 20 -- security for costs`

-- src:1879 | 20. —(1) The appellant must provide security for the respondent’s costs of the appeal and file a certificate for security for costs in Form 36 at the time the appellant files the notice of appeal. (2) Where there is more than one appellant in the same appeal, all the appellants need to provide only one set of security for the appeal.
