    `period direction` IS `After the anchor`
@ref O 18 r 25(5)(d) (src:1975)
`o 18 r 25(5)(d) the period after the filing and service of the notice of appeal` MEANS Period WITH
    `period length` IS 28
    `period unit` IS Days
    `period direction` IS `After the anchor`
@ref O 18 r 25(5) (src:1968-1977)
